"snippet":"<rom name=\"space fortress (1981)(astrocade inc.)(proto).bin\" size=\"2048\" crc=\"cf5012bd\" sha1=\"08510e05c81192908bb62330dc825e1f63052584\" /> ... <year>1979</year> ... <rom name=\"space invaders (197x)(ba","title":"File: astrocde.xml | Debian Sources","url":"https://sources.debian.org/src/mame/0.251%2Bdfsg.1-1/hash/astrocde.xml"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.mobygames.com","ref_id":"turn1search9","snippet":"aka: Astro Battle ... 1979 on Arcade ... As in \"Space Invaders\", the player can only have one bullet on the screen at a time,","title":"Astro Fighter (1979) - MobyGames","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/68805/astro-fighter/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"gamesdb.launchbox-app.com","ref_id":"turn1search10","snippet":"Astro Battle is a Space Invaders clone published by Bally Manufacturing in 1978 for the Bally Astrocade arcade system. ... https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astro_Battle_2009","title":"Astro Battle - LaunchBox Games Database","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/76324-astro-battle"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ballyalley.com","ref_id":"turn1search11","snippet":"Astro Battle was originally titled as Space Invaders. ... Summary of Galactic Invasion from the game's manual: \"Alien ships come at your missile launcher from","title":"Bally Alley - The Newsletter for Astrocade Users","url":"https://ballyalley.com/astrocade_videos/cartridge_videos/cartridge_videos.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn1search14","snippet":"Astro Battle 2009 or Astro Battle (since 2009 is the model number) is a Space Invaders clone published by Bally Manufacturing in 1979 for the","title":"Astro Battle 2009","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astro_Battle_2009"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.colecovisionadam.com","ref_id":"turn1search15","snippet":"First, wipe out the Astro-Invaders. ... GORF© 1980, GALAXIANS ©1979 Bally Midway Mfg. ... Game screen illustration labeled “PLAYER 1” with s